  _name: Retributive reckoning
  _description: When an enemy tries to inflict physical damage to Terafine in melee,
    from the back, then in response to this, the elf can move herself behind the
    opponent's back, while imposing a "Fear" debuff on him    "The leader of the
    huntsmen was famous for her flair before, but now, thanks to dark magic, Terafine
    is able to anticipate the actions of opponents"
